me><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>SEIREI IND</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>YANMAR AGRICULT EQUIP</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>HIDAKA, SHIGEMI</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>SEIREI INDUSTRY CO., LTD.</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>YANMAR AGRICULTURAL EQUIPMENT CO., LTD.</name></addressbook></applicant></applicants><inventors><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>HIDAKA SHIGEMI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>HIDAKA, SHIGEMI</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A work vehicle in which a driving force is transmitted to left and right travel crawlers (2) through a transmission member (25) for changing the traveling speed continuously by operating a travel transmission lever (73), and a steering member (28) is controlled by a steering wheel (19) to change the difference between the driving speeds of the left and right travel crawlers (2) continuously.  The vehicle speed determined by the control input of a travel transmission lever (73) is decelerated in proportion to the control input of the steering wheel (19), and the reduction ratio of the vehicle speed to the control input of the steering wheel (19) can be changed.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention porte sur un véhicule de travaux dans lequel une force d'entraînement est transmise aux chenilles (2) gauche et droite par un élément (25) de transmission afin de changer de manière continue la vitesse de circulation au moyen de la mise en oeuvre d'un levier (73) de transmission de déplacement, un élément (28) de direction étant commandé par un volant (19) pour changer en continu la différence entre les vitesses d'entraînement des chenilles (2) gauche et droite. La vitesse du véhicule déterminée par l'entrée de commande d'un levier (73) de transmission de déplacement est décélérée proportionnellement à l'entrée de commande du volant (19), le taux de réduction de la vitesse du véhicule par rapport à l'entrée de commande du volant (19) pouvant être changé.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>